# factlattice-reviewer: domain profile [PROFILE:FACTLATTICE-REVIEWER-PROFILE]

> Judges review documents (`REVIEW-`, `UNREVIEWED-` and their member nodes) and review extension documents (`REVEXT-`, `REVHOOK-`, `REVPROC-`, `REVRULE-`). Every required list below is a PINNED contract: renaming or removing a field bumps `review-format-version` (reviews) or the hook contract version (extensions), and `tests/test_reviewer_contracts.py` fails until the pin moves with it.

## [PROFILE-DOMAIN] Domain identity

- domain-id: factlattice-reviewer
- domain-name: factlattice-reviewer
- domain-version: 1
- conventions-source: factlattice_engine/reviewer/shipped/reviewer-core.lts (the node REVPROC-CORE)

## Registered node-id prefixes

### [PREFIX-REVIEW] REVIEW

- registers-prefix: REVIEW-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: a review document's root node

### [PREFIX-UNREVIEWED] UNREVIEWED

- registers-prefix: UNREVIEWED-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: the record written when a review could not run

### [PREFIX-REVFINDING] REVFINDING

- registers-prefix: REVFINDING-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: one rule applied to one node, with the evidence

### [PREFIX-REVCHECK] REVCHECK

- registers-prefix: REVCHECK-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: a rule that did not produce a finding (not applicable, errored, unreliable, passed)

### [PREFIX-REVPROV] REVPROV

- registers-prefix: REVPROV-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: which core procedure, extension or site configuration a review loaded, with its hash

### [PREFIX-REVEXT] REVEXT

- registers-prefix: REVEXT-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: the root of a review extension document

### [PREFIX-REVPROC] REVPROC

- registers-prefix: REVPROC-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: one step of a review procedure (core or extension)

### [PREFIX-REVRULE] REVRULE

- registers-prefix: REVRULE-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: one evaluation rule: deterministic (a query) or judgement (a question)

### [PREFIX-REVHOOK] REVHOOK

- registers-prefix: REVHOOK-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: a named point in the core procedure; in an extension, a stub for one

### [PREFIX-REVIEWER] REVIEWER

- registers-prefix: REVIEWER-
- document: factlattice-reviewer
- definition: the reviewer's shipped configuration (REVIEWER-CONFIG) and the site's (REVIEWER-SITE-CONFIG)

## Required and recommended properties

### [NODEFAMILY-REVIEW] REVIEW nodes

- section: review_review
- families: REVIEW-
- required:
  - review-format-version
  - verdict
  - reviewed-corpus
  - reviewed-document
  - reviewed-document-hash
  - node-count-reviewed
  - route
  - engine-build
  - query-surface
  - core-proc-source
  - core-proc-hash
  - extensions-applied
  - findings-by-severity
  - not-examined
  - caller-context
  - write-root-caveat
  - reviewer-model
  - creation-ledger-state
  - site-config
  - site-overrides
  - registry-mcp
  - registry-cli

### [NODEFAMILY-UNREVIEWED] UNREVIEWED nodes

