## Declared property keys

A document stamped `lts: "1.1"` rejects an undeclared key as a lint ERROR, so every key a review or an extension may carry is declared here. The built-in minting keys (`part-of`, `attaches-to-hook`, `applies-rule`) need no declaration and are refused if declared.

### [PROPKEY-REVIEWER] Review and extension keys

- property-keys:
